//? Title: Tarjan SCC: actual discovery, low links and component pops
//? Subtitle: Actual canonical histories, retained original fixtures and explicit controls
//? Exports: both
//? Lang: en-GB

\abstract(
Tarjan finds a directed graph partition in one depth-first traversal. The actual
explicit-stack producer records discovery, active-neighbor low-link updates,
child propagation and component pops while retaining legacy traversal IDs.
)

\toc

> Mechanism and mathematical scope

A vertex starts with discovery=low=the next counter and enters the active SCC
stack. For an already discovered active neighbor use its discovery number; after
a DFS child finishes propagate its low link. When low(u)=discovery(u), pop
active vertices through u as one component. Explicit call frames replace
recursion. Each adjacency entry is processed once, so work is O(V+E), including
loops and duplicates. Component IDs follow pop order and are not canonical
labels; independently compare mutual component membership, not arbitrary ID
equality.

> A tiny actual producing history

The table and native concept diagram read the same producing execution. Every
block below is a complete editable C++ program.

```{cpp, results="markdown", file="figures/tarjan_scc_tiny.svg", flags="-std=c++23 -O2 $(pkg-config --cflags --libs datamunge) -Wl,-rpath,$(pkg-config --variable=libdir datamunge)"}
#include <dm/dm.hpp>
int main() {
    namespace a = dm::algorithms;
    namespace g = dm::graphics;
    std::filesystem::create_directories("build");
    auto r = a::tarjan_scc_trace(3, {{1}, {0, 2}, {}});
    std::print("| actual action | vertex | other | discovery | low | component | active stack size |\n| --- " "| ---: | ---: | ---: | ---: | ---: | ---: |\n");
    for (const auto &s : r.steps)
        std::print("| {} | {} | {} | {} | {} | {} | {} |\n", s.action, s.vertex,
                   s.other, s.discovery, s.low, s.component, s.active);
    g::Diagram concept_diagram(48, 1100);
    concept_diagram.node("n0", {0, 0}, "Actual cycle0,1 with edge1->2");
    concept_diagram.node("n1", {5, 0},
                         std::format("{} actual directed edge visits",
                                     r.edge_visits));
    concept_diagram.node("n2", {10, 0},
                         std::format("Actual component IDs {}", r.components));
    concept_diagram.edge("n0", "n1").edge("n1", "n2");
    concept_diagram.save_svg("build/tarjan_scc_tiny.svg");
}
```
